WEBVTT

00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:16,530
Would your product for hormones work better than Cascuali? No. I mean, I would never say that

00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:27,170
supplement is going to do as good a job as a medication. So, um, but that's, I know why people,

00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:34,690
you know, the medication has all these negative side effects that, you know, are unpleasant

00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:42,050
and cause issues. So, people don't necessarily like to stay on those medications for that reason.

00:00:42,050 --> 00:00:49,090
So then they, they want to get on something that is, is maybe going to be a little bit, you know,

00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:56,690
less toxic to them.

